From 3cc12fa3cfc1962d13c8a0997b6591ff08a9e849 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mayi <3363523343@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:52:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(osdrv/wifi): add buildable CV181x ATBM6461 SDIO driver

Import vendor b1d1eeae8e95ab9a1670679f8599e968df6a495d sources and include the complete CV181x build/platform adaptation in this one feature.

Include Kbuild, RHEA/SDIO/24 MHz settings, vendor tool builds, CVITEK rescan callbacks, optional secure-boot default and Linux ioctl compatibility. Capture the SDIO-enable result for independent error handling and diagnostics patches.

No optional diagnostics, STA network service, power GPIO experiments, personal notes or generated executables. Two non-UTF8 vendor comment files are preserved as Git binary source hunks.
Prerequisite: osdrv manifest baseline only. Direct ARCH=arm module/tools builds are usable before the board selects this feature.
